            <a href={`/signup?next=${encodeURIComponent('/billing?upgrade=pro')}`} class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary px-4 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90">Get Pro · {promoMonthly}/mo</a>
